<%# The closing call to action, shared by the home page and every detail page.

  TWO DESTINATIONS, BOTH REAL. Account creation goes to the application's own registration path, and the
  second action is the published address rendered as a mailto: -- the old page's equivalent band offered a
  trial that cannot start (no plan row exists, and the trial plan id defaults to nil) beside a live-chat
  button that opened nothing (docs/official-website/02-verified-feature-inventory.md section 6).

  THE PAGE DOES NOT CLOSE ON THE FIELD IT OPENED ON. This was `bg-lyn-ink`, which was the right answer while
  it was the one dark field on an otherwise white page; now that the hero carries that field, an identical
  band at the foot made the page look like it had looped. The close is the brand's own gradient -- royal into
  indigo, the two colours the hero only pools behind its panel -- so the last thing a reader sees is the
  loudest thing on the page, and it is loud exactly once.

  THE BAND OWNS ITS OWN DISTANCE AND NOTHING ABOVE IT ADDS ANY. It carried an `mt-16` on top of the padding
  its caller already put under the last section; every section is now a band with its own vertical step, so
  a margin here would be a second, unreadable spacing stacked on a first.
%>
<section class="bg-lyn-royal bg-[linear-gradient(115deg,#1D3FA8_0%,#4038C9_52%,#5B5BF0_100%)]">
  <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-10 px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 lg:flex-row lg:items-end lg:justify-between lg:py-24">
    <div>
      <h2 class="max-w-xl text-balance text-3xl font-bold leading-[1.25] tracking-tight text-lyn-paper sm:text-[2.5rem]">
        <%= t('marketing.cta.title') %>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-lg leading-[1.8] text-lyn-paper/75"><%= t('marketing.cta.lede') %></p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex shrink-0 flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/app/register"
         class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center rounded-xl bg-lyn-paper px-7 text-base font-semibold text-lyn-royal transition-colors hover:bg-lyn-mist focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-lyn-paper">
        <%= t('marketing.cta.primary') %>
      </a>
      <a href="<%= marketing_support_email_url %>"
         class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center rounded-xl border border-lyn-paper/35 px-7 text-base font-semibold text-lyn-paper transition-colors hover:border-lyn-paper hover:bg-lyn-paper/10 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-lyn-paper">
        <%= t('marketing.cta.email') %>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
